Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.09,0:00:05.07,TL,,0,0,0,,去年{\fs78}11{\fs68}月
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.07,0:00:08.05,TL,,0,0,0,,霍达尔还是弗吉尼亚大学的学生球员
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.05,0:00:08.99,TL,,0,0,0,,今年{\fs78}11{\fs68}月
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.99,0:00:11.87,TL,,0,0,0,,他拿到了都灵最后一张门票
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.31,0:00:14.12,TL,,0,0,0,,先从澳网说起
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.12,0:00:15.65,TL,,0,0,0,,资格赛连过三关
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.65,0:00:17.67,TL,,0,0,0,,再赢下一场{\fs78}5{\fs68}盘大战
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.67,0:00:19.92,TL,,0,0,0,,拿到大满贯正赛首胜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.92,0:00:23.02,TL,,0,0,0,,第二轮 他{\fs78}3{\fs68}盘输给门西克
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.55,0:00:32.11,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}4{\fs68}月的马拉喀什
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.11,0:00:33.88,TL,,0,0,0,,两盘击败特伦杰利蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.88,0:00:36.50,TL,,0,0,0,,拿下生涯首座巡回赛冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.50,0:00:38.84,TL,,0,0,0,,这是他第一次参加巡回赛级别的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.84,0:00:40.48,TL,,0,0,0,,红土赛事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.93,0:00:43.35,TL,,0,0,0,,随后 巴塞罗那打进{\fs78}4{\fs68}强
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.35,0:00:46.19,TL,,0,0,0,,马德里和罗马连续打进{\fs78}8{\fs68}强
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.19,0:00:49.21,TL,,0,0,0,,红土上的突破还没有结束
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.66,0:00:52.06,TL,,0,0,0,,法网第四轮 先丢两盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.06,0:00:55.44,TL,,0,0,0,,他连扳{\fs78}3{\fs68}盘逆转卡雷尼奥 布斯塔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.44,0:00:57.46,TL,,0,0,0,,首次闯进大满贯{\fs78}8{\fs68}强
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.46,0:01:00.05,TL,,0,0,0,,随后{\fs78}3{\fs68}盘输给兹维列夫
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.77,0:01:18.29,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}[On-court result announcement]{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N【场上宣布比赛结果】
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.54,0:01:26.82,TL,,0,0,0,,温网第二轮 再赢一场{\fs78}5{\fs68}盘大战
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.82,0:01:28.64,TL,,0,0,0,,第三轮对望月慎太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.64,0:01:31.70,TL,,0,0,0,,先赢一盘 随后连丢{\fs78}3{\fs68}盘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.15,0:01:35.11,TL,,0,0,0,,华盛顿 连续逆转穆塞蒂和塔比洛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.11,0:01:37.63,TL,,0,0,0,,闯进生涯首个{\fs78}500{\fs68}赛决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.63,0:01:39.94,TL,,0,0,0,,对弗里茨 首盘抢七落败
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.94,0:01:41.96,TL,,0,0,0,,最终收获亚军
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.80,0:02:01.18,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A home champion in the capital.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N主场冠军 就在这座首都
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.18,0:02:04.44,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And for the American,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N对这位美国球员来说
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.44,0:02:08.00,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}it is his biggest title since 2022.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这是他自{\fs78}2022{\fs68}年以来最大的一冠
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.54,0:02:14.62,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}as he takes down the young Spaniard Rafael Jodar,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他击败了西班牙小将霍达尔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.62,0:02:16.78,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}who pushed him hard in those two sets.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N两盘都给他制造了不小的麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.11,0:02:17.73,TL,,0,0,0,,接着
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.73,0:02:21.07,TL,,0,0,0,,在蒙特利尔首次打进大师赛{\fs78}4{\fs68}强
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.07,0:02:22.10,TL,,0,0,0,,但来到美网
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.10,0:02:25.53,TL,,0,0,0,,他第一轮就{\fs78}3{\fs68}盘输给布云朝克特
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.33,0:02:34.69,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That'll do it.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N比赛结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.75,0:02:37.89,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That is the win of his career.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这是他生涯最重要的一场胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.59,0:02:44.62,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Yunchaokete has knocked out the 12th seed,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N布云朝克特淘汰了{\fs78}12{\fs68}号种子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.16,0:02:48.02,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and it has been emphatic today.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N而且他今天赢得相当强势
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.56,0:02:50.84,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}[Score] 6-2, 6-1, 6-1.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.48,0:02:54.67,TL,,0,0,0,,上海 前{\fs78}4{\fs68}场全部逆转过关
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.67,0:02:56.89,TL,,0,0,0,,半决赛两盘击败梅德韦德夫
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.89,0:02:59.38,TL,,0,0,0,,第一次走进大师赛决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.83,0:03:01.82,TL,,0,0,0,,对福基纳 他先赢一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.82,0:03:03.96,TL,,0,0,0,,第二盘又领先一个破发
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.96,0:03:05.05,TL,,0,0,0,,最终被逆转
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.05,0:03:07.84,TL,,0,0,0,,距离大师赛首冠还差一步
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.74,0:03:12.02,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Game, set, match.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N比赛结束
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.34,0:03:15.58,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Alejandro Davidovich Fokina{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N福基纳
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.58,0:03:22.18,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}claims a maiden Masters 1000 title in Shanghai.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N在上海夺得生涯首座大师赛冠军！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.45,0:03:28.29,TL,,0,0,0,,巴黎第二轮 两盘输给鲁德
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.29,0:03:32.36,TL,,0,0,0,,出局时 他的赛季积分来到{\fs78}3234{\fs68}分
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.36,0:03:34.62,TL,,0,0,0,,年终资格还要等待
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.07,0:03:36.10,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}11{\fs68}月{\fs78}6{\fs68}日
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.10,0:03:38.56,TL,,0,0,0,,阿尔卡拉斯在巴黎击败弗里茨
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.56,0:03:40.69,TL,,0,0,0,,霍达尔锁定最后一席
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.69,0:03:42.46,TL,,0,0,0,,一年前还是大学生的他
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.46,0:03:44.64,TL,,0,0,0,,今年第一次入围年终
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.09,0:03:48.38,TL,,0,0,100,,{\an2}截至{\fs78}11{\fs68}月{\fs78}7{\fs68}日 {\fs78}3234{\fs68}分
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.38,0:03:50.28,TL,,0,0,100,,{\an2}赛季积分榜第九
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.28,0:03:51.45,TL,,0,0,100,,{\an2}辛纳已退赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.45,0:03:55.07,TL,,0,0,100,,{\an2}霍达尔位列本届总决赛{\fs78}8{\fs68}位正选之中
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.52,0:03:56.95,TL,,0,0,0,,这一次在都灵
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.95,0:03:59.48,TL,,0,0,0,,你最想看霍达尔碰上谁？
